    section4Body: "The price behind easy pagri tying with a bespoke pagdi design isn't a single fixed figure — it moves with guest count, fabric choice, styling detail and travel distance for bookings outside our core area. What stays consistent across every package is what's actually included: the artist's time, full coordination of the tying order around your ceremony schedule, and attention to fit and finish for every person styled. Fabric itself is either supplied as part of the package or, if your family has already chosen fabric, we quote for tying support only — both are common requests. Accessories such as a kalgi, brooch or pearl detail are generally an optional add-on rather than something bundled into every booking automatically. If you'd like a number to plan around, share your event date, venue, approximate headcount and fabric preference together, and we'll respond with a package that's based on your actual event rather than a generic starting price.",
